notes               = "Printed with a title above the verse, so english_title renders the poet's own Persian title; the title line is lifted out of the body. Note the title is plural (درهای بسته) and the first line singular (دری بسته). شصت سالگی‌ام here is the round figure the poet uses four times between ۱۳۷۴ and ۱۳۸۳ for 'a whole life', not a literal age — page 159's fifty-five springs is the exact count. 24 Bahman = 13 February 1996. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
