===persian===

آزادی پشتِ دری بسته...
از روزنهٔ یک بوسه...
مرا به باغی برد... که بارانش،
گل‌های یاس بودند.
در سایهٔ درختانِ بیدمجنون،
کودکی‌ام را دیدم...
که با شصت سالگی‌ام...
آب‌بازی می‌کرد...
۱۳۷۴/۱۱/۲۴

===machine===

Freedom, behind a shut door...
through the chink of a single kiss...
carried me off to a garden whose rain
was jasmine flowers.
In the shade of the weeping willows
I saw my childhood...
splashing in the water...
with my sixtieth year...
1374/11/24

===lantern===

Freedom, behind a shut door,
through the chink of a single kiss,
carried me off to a garden whose rain
was jasmine flowers.
And in the shade of the weeping willows
I saw my childhood
splashing in the water
with my sixtieth year...

1374/11/24

